-- ERROR -------------------- errors/elif_keyword_1.march

March has no `elif`: an `else if` is a nested `if`, and each `if` needs its own `end`. [elif_keyword]

6 |     elif n < 0 do
        ^^^^

    if a do
        1
    else if b do
        2
    else
        3
    end end
    run `march --explain elif_keyword`
